{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/936f8d3b88dc16b06472020b2b898897.poster.avif?t=1760010004\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/936f8d3b88dc16b06472020b2b898897.webm?t=1760010004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/936f8d3b88dc16b06472020b2b898897.mp4?t=1760010004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>\ud83d\udc49Add Awakeroots to your wishlist to receive notification of the release and access to the demo.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> ---\u00a0<u>Early Access available in December 2025</u> ---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...set in Slavic folklore, Awakeroots combines elements of survival, strategy, and RPG. Players take on the role of settlers \u2013 pioneers in wild, mythical lands where nature and magic intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddf1 Build and Expand a Settlement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with nothing \u2013 and expand your own settlement from scratch. Create workshops and warehouses, protect yourself from threats, reinforce walls, create traps, and prepare for defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/8f74597a6e21d36a698bd79358786440.poster.avif?t=1760010004\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/8f74597a6e21d36a698bd79358786440.webm?t=1760010004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/8f74597a6e21d36a698bd79358786440.mp4?t=1760010004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf3e Farm the Land</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plant, cultivate, and harvest crops \u2013 your crops can become the foundation of survival... or a source of trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/56602c734012bb50cd3ea6289386f53e.poster.avif?t=1760010004\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/56602c734012bb50cd3ea6289386f53e.webm?t=1760010004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/extras/56602c734012bb50cd3ea6289386f53e.mp4?t=1760010004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf32 Explore Wilderness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wander through the unknown \u2013 discover forests, swamps, mountains, and ancient ruins. Discover ancient relics, hidden places, and the secrets of ancient tribes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udc79 Fight Slavic monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face creatures from ancient legends \u2013 Leshy, Rusalki, Poludnici, Utopci, and other dark beings that inhabit the dense forests and forgotten ruins at the edge of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Original graphic style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unique 2D visuals created by one of the brothers \u2013 inspired by ancient folk patterns and Slavic ornamentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddec The Spirit of Ancestors, the Power of Roots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Awakeroots is a game created out of passion by two brothers, a programmer and a graphic designer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882880?t=1760010004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/6a90f7bfc7fb720bdc432fd780c449a4a2af3384/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760010004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/d3ccbd30c8abbfb7af50dc4c89d8ce52bce89c2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760010004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882880/d3ccbd30c8abbfb7af50dc4c89d8ce52bce89c2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760010004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c